    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; }
        body { background-color: #121212; color: #e0e0e0; padding: 12px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; }
        .card { background: #1e1e1e; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; border: 1px solid #444; box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
        h1 { color: #ff5252; font-size: 20px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 1px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
        .author-tag { font-size: 11px; color: #888; margin-bottom: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #333; padding-bottom: 6px; }
        h2 { color: #ffb74d; font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 6px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 800; }
        .snark-text { font-size: 12px; color: #9e9e9e; margin-bottom: 12px; font-style: italic; border-left: 3px solid #ff5252; padding-left: 8px; }
        
        /* VE Table Grid Styles matching Power Vision manual orientation */
        .ve-table-wrapper { overflow-x: auto; margin-top: 10px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #555; }
        table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 11px; text-align: center; }
        th, td { border: 1px solid #444; padding: 10px 4px; font-weight: bold; }
        th { background: #333; color: #fff; }
        .row-header { background: #333; font-weight: bold; width: 65px; }
        
        /* Quick Tune Overlays based strictly on manual layout */
        .zone-decel { background-color: rgba(33, 150, 243, 0.6); color: #fff; }   /* Low/Decel Column (Left) */
        .zone-low   { background-color: rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.4); color: #fff; }    /* Low RPM */
        .zone-med   { background-color: rgba(255, 152, 0, 0.5); color: #000; }    /* Med RPM */
        .zone-high  { background-color: rgba(244, 67, 54, 0.5); color: #fff; }    /* High RPM */
        .zone-lugs  { background-color: rgba(156, 39, 176, 0.6); color: #fff; }   /* Lugging/WOT Corner */

        .legend { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 12px; }
        .legend-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; background: #2a2a2a; padding: 6px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid #444;}
        .legend-color { width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid #888; flex-shrink: 0; }

        footer { text-align: center; font-size: 10px; color: #666; margin-top: 24px; padding: 16px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="card" style="border-color: #ff5252;">
        <h1>Tuner.Buddy</h1>
        <h2 style="font-size: 12px; color:#fff;">Manual Layout Grid (v11)</h2>
        <div class="author-tag">By Lee Thomas Cramblit &copy; 2026. All Rights Reserved.</div>
        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #ccc;">
            Because letting wideband auto-tune run blind without respecting your decel/idle and lug zones is a quick ticket to melted pistons. Here's the layout mapped right.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2>🗺️ Quick Tune Overlay & Manual Grid Layout</h2>
        <div class="snark-text">
            Decel column sits isolated on the far left (touch it wrong and it won't start or idles like a super-rich swamp), Low/Med/High span horizontally, and heavy load/lugging zones occupy the lower right corners. Generic test values (5157234666) populated for layout verification.
        </div>

        <div class="legend">
            <div class="legend-item">
                <div class="legend-color" style="background: rgba(33, 150, 243, 0.8);"></div> 
                <strong>DECEL COLUMN (Left Side):</strong> Controls overrun, idle catch, and decel pop. Too lean = won't start; too rich = super rich idle.
            </div>
            <div class="legend-item">
                <div class="legend-color" style="background: rgba(76, 175, 80, 0.8);"></div> 
                <strong>LOW RPM / CRUISE ZONES:</strong> Stable light-load travel columns.
            </div>
            <div class="legend-item">
                <div class="legend-color" style="background: rgba(255, 152, 0, 0.8);"></div> 
                <strong>MED RPM ZONE:</strong> Transition and roll-on territory.
            </div>
            <div class="legend-item">
                <div class="legend-color" style="background: rgba(156, 39, 176, 0.8);"></div> 
                <strong>LUG / HIGH ZONE:</strong> Bottom-right high-load corner where detonation happens if left lean.
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="ve-table-wrapper">
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th class="row-header">Throttle \ RPM</th>
                        <th>Decel / 0%</th>
                        <th>Low (1000-1500)</th>
                        <th>Med (2000-3000)</th>
                        <th>High (4000-7000)</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="row-header">Closed / Idle</td>
                        <td class="zone-decel">5157234666</td>
                        <td class="zone-low">5157234666</td>
                        <td class="zone-low">5157234666</td>
                        <td class="zone-med">5157234666</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="row-header">Light (10-20%)</td>
                        <td class="zone-decel">5157234666</td>
                        <td class="zone-low">5157234666</td>
                        <td class="zone-med">5157234666</td>
                        <td class="zone-high">5157234666</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="row-header">Cruise (30-50%)</td>
                        <td class="zone-decel">5157234666</td>
                        <td class="zone-med">5157234666</td>
                        <td class="zone-med">5157234666</td>
                        <td class="zone-high">5157234666</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td class="row-header">WOT (100%)</td>
                        <td class="zone-decel">5157234666</td>
                        <td class="zone-lugs">5157234666</td>
                        <td class="zone-high">5157234666</td>
                        <td class="zone-lugs">5157234666</td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        Tuner.Buddy v11 | Real Mechanics &gt; Forum Idiots | &copy; 2026 Lee Thomas Cramblit. All Rights Reserved.
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
